18	/**
19	 * The single derived duplicate-detection key for an owner: the normalized telephone, the email
20	 * (or empty) and the household id, joined with '|'. Two owners are duplicates only when their whole
21	 * key matches. The household id is not carried on the persisted owner, so it contributes empty here.
